    "title": "Growing together: letʼs congratulate Yulia Panchenko on her new role as Product Engineer",
    "summary": "A new professional milestone is always a bright reason to celebrate — and today, we’re joining Yulia in marking it!",
    "cover": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/686d0fd099ee65617e107e24/6aa142300fa0372cb6ad5dda_New%20position-update.jpg",
    "accentColor": "",
    "readTime": "1 min",
