    "title": "A conversation that goes beyond construction",
    "summary": "The conversation explores how Ukraine is already shaping the future of construction through resilience, engineering, digital transformation, and new approaches born out of necessity.",
    "cover": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/686d0fd099ee65617e107e24/6aa14d2a136aaa3160eed067_Bricks%2C%20Bucks%20%26%20Bytes%20podcast.jpg",
