    "title": "Growing together: Andrii Kutovenko has become a Technical Leader of Wood Structure",
    "summary": "Andrii takes on a new role to lead systems teams, optimize resources, and ensure high-quality project delivery.",
    "cover": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/686d0fd099ee65617e107e24/69b0458f41a80fc758f6f3a9_Web%20cover%20person-8.jpg",
